"P461668990" "Thank you, my friend. I knew... that I could count on my kindred... I knew I would find a ray of hope in this, my darkest hour. I... am tired... {HeroName}. Go quickly, now, my friend. You are my last chance... to escape here.<br><br>I will rest now... I must reserve... my strength so that I may survive... until you find me."
// AcceptString :
"P4164257997" "Don't worry, Huntress. I'll get you out of this."
// SendOffString :
"P1142175130" "I know... of that I have no doubt. Thank you, {HeroName}. Now go."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2458632808" "Investigate Alysonde's Lair"
