// SaysList :
"P3625820058" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>I... I can feel your emotions. You... are confused. <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>My lair... it looks like a chamber of the Circle. <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>You... you are right. I claimed it from them... and... <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>and with the blessing of Statesman... I have cleansed it of their curse.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue> It has taught us much we did not know... though I fear that ends now."
// SaysList :
"P1389158569" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>Deathfrost... was there? <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>It must have been working with... my captors. <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>It has been trying... to reclaim this place... for years... but could never succeed until now. <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>That could only have been done... with assistance."

