// Dialog :
"P413744432" "You have survived the Circle of Thorns counter-attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - SecurityGlyphAcquired 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1091294750" "Glyph of Unrelenting Memory"
// Description :
"P1959975979" "Access the Glyph of Unrelenting Memory"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3224212321" "As you reach for the glyph, you feel a  surge of energy. Alysonde channels the access spell through you."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P3350357126" "The access spell has been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3765819130" "You feel the energy surge subside as the access spell concludes. The security records for the lair are now available to you."
// InteractActionString :
"P4286608023" "Performing the spell of access..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3377257863" "You have recovered the security information from the glyph."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P108762587" "You have cleared the Circle from Alysonde's lair and discovered the information about her abduction from the security glyph."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2365989465" "I... I have seen what you have seen. He was there... he was behind this... and I know now what will happen to me... should you not find me in time. My captor.... Once, his name was <color FireBrick>John Sanborn<color>. He and I were colleagues... then friends... then.... Suffice to say, it was... one of the happiest times of my mortal life.<br><br>But, I learned... too late... that there was always jealousy within him. He coveted the discoveries of others... and was determined to be the one... to make the greatest discovery of all. He believed... that it was his destiny... to be blessed... to be the one who became like the gods.<br><br>It was not to be... I was the one chosen... I was the one blessed... and in John's mind, I had betrayed him. In his anger, he... slaughtered our friends... destroyed our labs... he became a monster. He took on the name <color FireBrick>'Desideratus'</color>... and has made it his life's mission... to take from me what he believed was rightfully his... and to destroy all who he believes to have wronged him.<br><br>I did not want this life... but perhaps that is why I was chosen where he was not. That... did not make the pain... of hurting him... of seeing what he became... of the suffering of my world... any easier. The only consolation... was that I could do good in this world... and that I would one day bring an end... to his reign of terror.<br><br>I did not imagine... that he would ever succeed, however, in bringing an end... to me. And that is my failing, for despite the power I have been granted& I have behaved like the naïve young woman I once was. I did not anticipate... the driving power of hatred and revenge. They have called me <color RoyalBlue>The Huntress</color>, but in reality, I have always been <color LightSlateGray>The Hunted</color>. And now... I am running out of time.<br><br>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - JacksonCarter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1172823730" "You have a lot of nerve storming in here, {HeroName}! Do you have any idea how hard I've worked to infiltrate the Sky Raiders? Now you've blown the entire operation sky high. I'm done here... this operation is done!"
// Answer Text :
"P1174635590" "Your operation looked pretty blown when I saved you, Carter."
// Page BlownCover Text :
"P3062903438" "Saved me? <color Gold><i>Saved me!</i></color> That's a matter of opinion!<br><br>Now, I'm not saying I'm not grateful you showed up and helped out, but I had that situation well under control. I'd have mopped them up, radioed in a stand-down order and no one would have been the wiser.<br><br>But, no... you had to come in here guns blazing and start tearing the place apart. I hope you have a really... and I mean <i>really</i>... good reason for this."
// Answer Text :
"P1812739816" "I do. Alysonde has been captured. She sent me to you."
// Page MyReasons Text :
"P3034842322" "Wait, what? You can't be serious. People have been trying for years to take her down. No one can get into her lair, and when she's out in the field, she's basically untouchable!<br><br>No, this doesn't make sense. How was she captured? The only way someone can get into her lair would be if one of us sold her out. Come to think of it, who blew the whistle on <i>me</i>. I've been here for ages. The only way this goes down is if I've been thrown to the wolves.<br><br><color MediumSpringGreen>As Carter pauses to think, you see his expression change from confused to stern.</color><br><br>Wait a minute... who are you? How is it that <i>you</i> know <color RoyalBlue>the Huntress</color> has been captured and none of her team does? How do I know that you haven't gone rogue and aren't just trying to lure us out with your lies? For all I know, you're <i>working</i> for the traitor who's sold us out!"
// Answer Text :
"P3111321280" "I have evidence in this glyph. See for yourself."
// Page LookAtEvidence Text :
"P1833967786" ""Well, I'll be.. that's ol' <color FireBrick>Johnny</color>. That twisted nutjob's been blaming <color RoyalBlue>Alysonde</color> for all his problems for <i>years</i>. He's got more than a few screws loose and he plays it fast and loose with the law, making himself a ton of money and contacts. We've tried to take him down before, but nothing ever seems to stick. But, that's nothing new. What's new is that he's hear strolling into <color RoyalBlue>Alysonde's</color> lair like he owned the place. Let me listen a bit closer.<br><br><color MediumSpringGreen>Carter holds the glyph to his ear and listens intently. A few moments later, his eyes grow wide.</color><br><br>It... it was <color Purple>Arrawyn</color>. Man, I knew that girl always wanted more, but this won't do anything but get us all killed!<br><br>Alright, {HeroName}, this ain't your fault. Once <color Purple>Arrawyn</color> joined up with ol' <color FireBrick>Johnny</color>, this operation was toast. We gotta have a plan if we're going to get out of here alive and find <color RoyalBlue>Alysonde.</color> Got any ideas?"
// Answer Text :
"P3812076572" "I need access to the Sky Raider Mainframe. Can you do it?"
// Page NeedHelp Text :
"P183481395" "Can I do it? Can I do it?! Of course I can! Who do you think built their security network?! I've just... well, I've never gotten the clearance to do so, because we couldn't risk the lives of all our people inside the organization.<br><br>That's all out the window now though, so just get me to one of the central mainframe terminals in one piece and I'll unlock it for you. I assume you know what you're looking for, so I'll beat it out of here once you're in. It'll be harder for both of us to try to escape together, I think."
// Answer Text :
"P1895252386" "Great. Let's go then, Carter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P81281848" "Knowing that <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> is behind this, {HeroName}... I believe that this information will lead you to me. While my foe... tends to remain behind the scenes... he has amassed great wealth and power. With this behind him... he has made many friends amongst the villains who trouble our world.... He turns to them... as his own personal armies, promising them much and delivering more.<br><br>One organization in particular, however... serves as his primary force. The Sky Raiders... they have been on his side for many an operation. I suspect that... that they must have had some role... and that they could reveal to you... what <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> has planned.<br><br>I have... allies... within their organization, watching them. One of these allies... <color Orange>Jackson Carter</color>... is certain to have the clearance necessary... to hack into the Sky Raider databases. From there... you may be able to learn something. I... need you... to find <color Orange>Carter</color>. I need... you... to...."
// AcceptString :
"P1781134423" "Huntress? If you can hear me, I will find Carter. This will be over soon, you have my word."
// SendOffString :
"P3613885386" "<color MediumSpringGreen>The Huntress is silent. It seems as though she has passed out, though you think you can faintly hear her own thoughts. Whatever the case may be, she can help you no further. You're going to need to find Carter on your own.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1368671868" "Raid Sky Raider Base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3926080457" "<color MediumSpringGreen>The Huntress is silent, though you think you can hear echoes of her fevered dreams.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1944509564" "<color LightSlateGray>Part Two:</color> <color GhostWhite>Infiltration</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
