"P1543018335" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>I... must warn you... Carter has been embedded with the Raiders for a long time.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>He may not take it... very well... when you show up.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>Do not be afraid... he will come around if you are direct.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>Just see to it... that he escapes... because this will certainly compromise... his cover."

