// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - SkyRaiderTerminal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1459859226" "Sky Raider Datacenter Terminal"
// Description :
"P160608137" "Hack into SkyDB"
// InteractBeginString :
"P372431879" "You begin searching the SkyDB for its records on Desideratus."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P3172797156" "You suspend your file search."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1528332014" "You have discovered the Sky Raider's files on Desideratus."
// InteractActionString :
"P3945540758" "SkyDB Access Granted... Running Query"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2333923457" "You have found information pertaining to Alysonde's abduction, code-named 'Operation: Huntress'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3066656552" "You have learned the location of Alysonde's weaponry. Her whereabouts remain unknown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2536303543" "I... I must apologize, {HeroName}... I did not wish to fall unconscious previously, but the pain... it is too intense sometimes. I can tell though... that you are hopeful...<br><br>Oh, yes... I can see now. I am glad... that you were able to reach <color Orange>Jackson</color>... and from the sound of it, it was just in time. I cannot... believe... that one of my own... sisters... would have done such a thing to us.... However, the glyph... and now these files... corroborate each other, so there can be... no doubt. I did not realize... that <color Purple>Arrawyn's</color> jealousy... ran so deeply... but, there appear to be many things I did not realize.<br><br>I am just as surprised, though, that <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> has managed to convince... <color LightSteelBlue>the Coralax</color> to aid him. They despise all humanity... that they would agree to work with him... is unexpected."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3476466254" "What are you waiting for, earthwalker? Strike the final blow and be done with it! It is all you and your ilk know to do!"
// Answer Text :
"P2475466284" "Calm down, Devilscale. I just need information."
// Answer Text :
"P103939628" "Tell me what I want to know, and I have no reason to kill you."
// Answer Text :
"P3214615886" "I might still do that, but first I want some information!"
// Page QuestionAndAnswerParagon Text :
"P2220106615" "Calm down, you say? You are aware that your kind sees us as monsters? Your kind kills us on sight, even though we were once like you. You show us no sympathy, no kindess, but yet I must be calm? I should kill you while I have the chance!"
// Answer Text :
"P3560536599" "We earthwalkers are not all the same, you know."
// Page QuestionAndAnswerNeutral Text :
"P1820087686" "I am certain you will find a reason. I have never known an earthwalker to show mercy to my kind, even if we were once just like you. We only act to defend ourselves from your slaughter. You treat us like monsters, like abominations and why? Because we are different!?"
// Answer Text :
"P3426498430" "You problems do not concern me. Just your information."
// Page QuestionAndAnswerTyrant Text :
"P1538448778" "Typical. I did not expect anything else from a filthy earthwalker. Merciless aggression and hatred is your kind's trademark! We are called monsters, but in truth, it is you who are the monster. Just kill me now, monster, for you will get nothing out of me!"
// Answer Text :
"P1638834742" "Enough! Talk now!"
// Page QuestionAndAnswer Text :
"P2589704175" "Oh, really, earthwalker? Fine, I'll play your little game. What is it you want to know?"
// Answer Text :
"P1741191419" "Desideratus is an earthwalker. Why are you working with him?"
// Page Desideratus Text :
"P2225972659" "<color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> is different. He came to us not with weapons in hand, but with hand outstretched. He said that even though he did not look like us, he knew suffering at the hands of the earthwalkers. He brought to us an offer of peace and cooperation, a world free of earthwalker torment!<br><br>For he had turned one of <color RoyalBlue>the Huntress'</color> cadre, a brash, jealous young womand named <color Purple>Arrawyn</color>. The woman gave <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> the secret to entering <color RoyalBlue>Alysonde's</color> lair. With that secret now open to us, <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> recruited the Circle to enter the lair and disable the wards which protected it, while we were to steal through the shadows and strike down <color RoyalBlue>the Huntress</color> unawares.<br><br>The plan worked well. She was caught without warning, and thus stood no chance.<br><br>For their service, the Circle regained their stolen chamber. However, since it was we who brought him <color RoyalBlue>the Huntress</color>, his tormentor, we asked that he give us her mighty weapons in exchange. Those powerful artifacts which have killed many of our kind. Now, they shall be used to hunt the earthwalker."
// Answer Text :
"P1929277415" "He plans to replace the Huntress, Devilscale. He needs those weapons."
// Page ThePlotRevealed Text :
"P4253063797" "You speak lies, earthwalker! <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> is one of us! He promised us that the world would be free of our tormentors!<br><br>Do you really think he would have entrusted us with keeping the weapons secure if he did not mean to let us have them?"
// Answer Text :
"P1110552545" "You really don't know what's going on, do you? Take a look at this... (Show the Evidence)"
// Page EnragedDevilscale Text :
"P2645051706" "Wretched earthwalkers! All of you! We should never have trusted any of you! The secrets we have revealed to him... he could destroy us! Our anger... it made us blind to his lies!<br><br>You, earthwalker, you want this traitor, you may have him! We have protected him within the <color DeepSkyBlue>Temple of the Waters</color>, and it is there he plans on slaughtering <color RoyalBlue>the Huntress</color>.<br><br>So... there! Now you have the information you seek? Tell me, how does this end for us, earthwalker? Am I free to warn my kindred or will you betray me as all earthwalkers do?"
// Answer Text :
"P2724825798" "You are free to go, Devilscale. Don't let our paths cross again."
// Answer Text :
"P684132136" "I think I'll just kill you anyway, Devilscale."
// Page DevilscaleShutoff Text :
"P1837936696" "I will not, earthwalker! You do not control <color LightSteelBlue>the Coralax</color> and I will not betray our secrets to you! Just kill me now and be done with it!"
// Answer Text :
"P2477042715" "Whoa, whoa. Take a step back here. I just want some answers."
// Answer Text :
"P510691332" "If that's how you want it, Devilscale, I'm happy to oblige... (Kill Devilscale)"
// Page DevilscaleFreed Text :
"P576352627" "They will not, earthwalker. I can assure you of that."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page DevilscaleBetrayed Text :
"P333140458" "I knew it. Filthy earthwalker! I am going... to...<br><br><color MediumSpringGreen>Before Devilscale can finish her thought, you grab her by the throat and snap her neck. Throwing the lifeless corpse to the ground, you move on to find some actual information about the Huntress' location.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2898242266" "Leave the corpse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2768049391" "Still, with these files... I am sure that you have already determined... the next course of action. Though there is little in there concerning... my whereabouts, the Sky Raider files do mention that <color LightSteelBlue>the Coralax</color> leader, <color Crimson>Devilscale</color>, has been... assigned the task... of defending my weaponry, a key source of the powers I wield. They are powerful artifacts... but unless wielded by <color RoyalBlue>the Hunter</color>, they hold no more power than any other weapon. So long as I live, they are bound to me... so I can only assume they are hidden among <color LightSteelBlue>the Coralax</color>... because <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> wishes to keep them... away... from... me... until he is ready to kill me.<br><br>Still, why leave them with <color LightSteelBlue>the Coralax</color>? Have you found... oh, dear... you have... I see your thoughts. He uses the weapons to keep them under his thumb... but he means to betray them... reclaim the weapons... and then there will be no loose ends to tie up. He will be free to claim his prize... he will be free to kill me and become <color RoyalBlue>the Hunter</color>... free to tyrannize the world.<br><br>You... you must... hurry, {HeroName}. If you do not recover... those weapons... and find where I have been hidden... from <color LightSteelBlue>the Coralax</color>... no one will stop him! Please {HeroName}... you must stop him. Even if I die... you must see this through to the end... you must... stop... <color FireBrick>Desidera... tus....</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2633892493" "I will stop this madman, Huntress."
// SendOffString :
"P3303242155" "You... you... must hurry, {HeroName}. There is not much time left... already he moves against the Circle... and... those... here... I can hear it....<br><br><color MediumSpringGreen>Alysonde falls silent. You think you can hear her breathing, but it is much shallower than before.</color><br><br>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2426395971" "Raid the Coralax Den"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2083262417" "<color MediumSpringGreen>The Huntress murmurs in her delirious sleep</color><br><br>How could I not have seen... this is all my fault."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3105576983" "<color LightSlateGray>Part Three:</color> <color GhostWhite>Reclamation</color>"

