"P3132947835" "You have found a computer tablet with Alysonde's location and other details of the plot amongst the debris."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1846874191" "You have recovered the weapons of the Huntress and found where Desideratus' is holding her prisoner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3270708162" "<color MediumSpringGreen>You gently rouse the Huntress from her unconsciousness</color>.<br><br>{HeroName}? Have you... is it too late? No... no... I am still... alive... there is still time.... And you have found them! Good... without those weapons, <color Firebrick>Desideratus</color> will not be able... to complete his plans.... {HeroName}, you have already done so much... and though I know... that <color Orange>Carter</color> can take it from here... I wish for you to lead the operation to stop <color Firebrick>Desideratus</color>. For even without the weapons... I fear he may have another way... to make himself <color RoyalBlue>the Hunter</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1123175684" "You have learned... that I am in the <color DeepSkyBlue>Temple... of the Waters</color>. I too... learned this... as I slept. This place... it is a cavern of legendary power... home to something that even I do not quite understand. In my delirium, it... spoke to me... and what it has told me in these last frenzied nightmares... is horrifying. By giving himself... as a servant of this... presence... <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> can claim a share of its energy... for himself. This... place... this presence... it teems with an energy I cannot describe... an energy which can give <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color>... the means... to tear the essence of <color RoyalBlue>the Hunter</color> from me... to make it his own.<br><br><color RoyalBlue>The Hunter</color> and <color SteelBlue>the Leviathan</color>... even a part of it... within one entity... could be of a power to challenge... all the heroes and villains of the world. There is nothing... nothing that could stop <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> should he... succeed. This is no longer just about... rescuing me... this is about saving the world.<br><br>{HeroName}... all of mankind needs you... please..."
// AcceptString :
"P3740632753" "Well, then... it's time to take Desideratus down once and for all!"
// SendOffString :
"P4190647287" "I... wish... you luck, then, {HeroName}. Should I happen to... live through this... you will have my eternal thanks. Now, make haste!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2502839463" "Stop Desideratus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P98543849" "Please... {HeroName}... we are running out of time! <color FireBrick>Desideratus</color> must be stopped!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2396854333" "<color LightSlateGray>Part Four:</color> <color GhostWhite>Resolution</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2062207384" "The cavern echoes with the sound of Sky Raider jetpacks. The Coralax are all dead... and you are almost out of time."

