"P2182318041" "This is Alysonde, the Huntress. Her wings bear many wounds and her body is bruised from the shackles she wore until recently. Though her powers of regeneration will enable her to recover, her mind is also nearly shattered and, though powerful, she is in no condition to aid you in this battle. It would be best for you to get her to safety as soon as possible."

