// Dialog :
"P2467483354" "You have saved the world, rescued Alysonde and put an end to Desideratus' plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1178036501" "You are alive, my friend, and for that I am grateful! Truthfully, I feared that I was sending you to your death in there, but you never once flinched or hesitated in the face of this threat. That is truly admirable, and the world will forever be in your debt. <i>I</i> will forever be in your debt, as well, for without your efforts, I would surely be dead.<br><br>I do not have much I can offer you, however. Most of my most valuable items were stolen or destroyed when the Circle raided my lair, and most of the rest of my organization is trying to recover from the immense harm <color Purple>Arrawyn</color> did in revealing our secrets. The one thing I can offer, however, is a feather from my wings. Take it as a sign of my gratitude and my adoration. Know that you will always be in my thoughts...."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P3130755004" "I've heard rumors that {HeroName} saved the world from a madman named Desideratus. No one seems to know the details, though."
